cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these scripts or adaptations substantially based on them in scholarly
  research, please cite the associated chapter listed in the references below.
type: software
title: "Prosopographical Network Analysis of the Archive of Nūr-Šamaš"
authors:
  - family-names: Gonçalves
    given-names: Carlos
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  Four Python scripts for parsing Old Babylonian loan contracts, normalizing
  and disambiguating personal names, constructing a co-occurrence network,
  detecting communities, and producing a prosopographical roster for the
  archive of Nūr-Šamaš.
references:
